{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Three Routes: Run &amp; Walk 是一款將路線規劃、GPS 跑步與步行記錄、5K/10K 訓練、力量及伸展集中在一起的運動 App，適合想建立穩定運動習慣的用戶。現時終生版內購限時免費，原價 US $29.99，毋須訂閱即可長久使用。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-56.webp\">\n<h2>路線規劃與運動記錄</h2>\n<p>Three Routes 把路線規劃、GPS 運動記錄、5K 或 10K 訓練、力量與伸展整合於一身。用戶可透過 Apple Maps 行人指示尋找最多三條路線，規劃環形或原路折返，亦可按距離、時間與步速設定；訓練計劃可一鍵配合路線，記錄戶外步行與跑步，支援 Apple Watch 語音提示及觸覺回饋，並可保存路線、分享 GPX，以及用手機鏡頭計深蹲。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-302-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-303-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-304-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-305-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-306-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-307-scaled.jpg\">\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Three Routes: Run &amp; Walk 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Three Routes: Run &amp; Walk</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T20:44:22.233738+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":496,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T20:26:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T08:38:42.613489+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T20:38:28.335199+00:00","content_hash":"048996483782ae38188be39ec5713d1ba15c23987a050cf520084b51cdac8f60","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}